<div class="resolve-app" id="resolveApp">
  <header class="resolve-header">
    <a href="/" class="resolve-back">← RESOLVE corpus</a>
    <h1>Governed Conversational Assistant</h1>
    <p class="resolve-subtitle">Seed-derived from <a href="/doc/282-the-essential-constraints-of-claude-code">Doc 282</a>. <a href="/doc/211-the-entrace-stack">ENTRACE Stack</a> active. <a href="/doc/265-entracement-study-meta-analysis">Empirical study</a> (Cohen's d > 3).</p>
  </header>

  <!-- API Key Entry (shown first, key stored in sessionStorage only) -->
  <div id="keyEntry">
    <div class="key-notice">
      <h2>Bring Your Own Key</h2>
      <p>This assistant runs on <strong>your</strong> Anthropic API key. Your key is stored only in your browser's session memory — it is <strong>never</strong> sent to or stored on this server. When you close this tab, the key is gone.</p>
      <p style="color:#888;font-size:0.8rem;">The server operator's key is not used. Your key is passed directly to api.anthropic.com. <a href="https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys" style="color:#ff8800;">Get an API key</a></p>
      <input type="password" id="apiKeyInput" placeholder="sk-ant-api03-..." style="width:100%;padding:0.5rem;font-family:monospace;background:#111;color:#eee;border:1px solid #333;margin:1rem 0;">
      <button id="saveKey" class="resolve-btn">Enter</button>
      <div style="margin-top:1.5rem;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid #222;">
        <button id="showCodeEntry" class="resolve-btn" style="background:#222;color:#4a9;">Show Me the Code</button>
        <p style="color:#666;font-size:0.75rem;margin-top:0.5rem;">Don't trust me. See how to make insecurity an architectural impossibility.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Chat area (hidden until key is provided) -->
  <div id="chatContainer" style="display:none;">
    <div class="resolve-sessions">
      <button id="newSession" class="resolve-btn">+ New Session</button>
      <button id="clearKey" class="resolve-btn" style="background:#333;color:#aaa;margin-left:0.5rem;">Change Key</button>
      <button id="showCode" class="resolve-btn" style="background:#222;color:#4a9;margin-left:0.5rem;">Show Me the Code</button>
      <div id="sessions"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="resolve-chat" id="chatArea" style="display:none;">
      <div class="resolve-messages" id="messages"></div>
      <form id="chatForm" class="resolve-input">
        <textarea id="userInput" placeholder="Your prompt..." rows="3"></textarea>
        <button type="submit" class="resolve-send">Send</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.resolve-app { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 1rem; font-family: monospace; color: #eee; }
.resolve-header { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
.resolve-header h1 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 0.25rem; }
.resolve-subtitle { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #888; }
.resolve-subtitle a { color: #ff8800; }
.resolve-back { color: #ff8800; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; }
.key-notice { max-width: 500px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid #333; }
.key-notice h2 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 0.75rem; }
.key-notice p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #bbb; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
.resolve-sessions { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.resolve-btn { background: #ff8800; color: #000; border: none; padding: 0.4rem 1rem; font-family: monospace; cursor: pointer; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
#sessions { max-height: 200px; overflow-y: auto; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
#sessions .session-item { padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem; cursor: pointer; border-bottom: 1px solid #222; font-size: 0.85rem; color: #aaa; }
#sessions .session-item:hover { color: #ff8800; }
.resolve-chat { display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: calc(100vh - 280px); }
.resolve-messages { flex: 1; overflow-y: auto; padding: 1rem 0; }
.resolve-messages .msg { margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 0.5rem; border-left: 2px solid #333; }
.resolve-messages .msg.user { border-left-color: #ff8800; }
.resolve-messages .msg.assistant { border-left-color: #4a9; }
.resolve-messages .msg .role { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #666; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
.resolve-messages .msg .content { white-space: pre-wrap; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.5; }
.resolve-input { display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; }
.resolve-input textarea { flex: 1; background: #111; color: #eee; border: 1px solid #333; padding: 0.5rem; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.9rem; resize: vertical; }
.resolve-send { background: #ff8800; color: #000; border: none; padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem; font-family: monospace; cursor: pointer; align-self: flex-end; }
.resolve-send:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }
.thinking { color: #666; font-style: italic; }
</style>

<!-- Code transparency panel -->
<div id="codePanel" style="display:none;" class="code-panel">
  <div class="code-header">
    <h2>Full Server Source — resolve-module.ts</h2>
    <p>This is the complete server-side code that handles your API key and chat requests. Read it. Verify that your key is never stored.</p>
    <button id="hideCode" class="resolve-btn" style="background:#333;color:#aaa;">Close</button>
  </div>
  <div class="code-audit">
    <h3>Security audit summary</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Line 52–55:</strong> Comment block explicitly states keys are NEVER persisted, NEVER logged, NEVER stored in the session database.</li>
      <li><strong>Line 57–62:</strong> <code>extractApiKey()</code> reads the key from the <code>X-Api-Key</code> header. This is the ONLY place the server touches your key.</li>
      <li><strong>Line 64–87:</strong> <code>callClaude()</code> passes the key directly to <code>api.anthropic.com</code> via fetch. The key exists in memory for this one request.</li>
      <li><strong>Line 173:</strong> The key variable <code>userApiKey</code> is scoped to the request handler. When the response is sent, the variable is garbage-collected.</li>
      <li><strong>Lines 31–50:</strong> The SQLite schema stores sessions (id, created_at, title) and messages (role, content). No key column exists.</li>
      <li><strong>Client side:</strong> Your key lives in <code>sessionStorage</code> (not <code>localStorage</code>). It is deleted when you close the tab. It is never written to a cookie or sent as a URL parameter.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <pre class="code-source"><code id="sourceCode">Loading...</code></pre>
</div>

<style>
.code-panel { margin: 1rem 0; padding: 1rem; border: 1px solid #333; background: #0a0a0a; max-height: 80vh; overflow-y: auto; }
.code-header { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.code-header h2 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; color: #4a9; }
.code-header p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #888; }
.code-audit { margin-bottom: 1rem; padding: 1rem; background: #111; border-left: 2px solid #4a9; }
.code-audit h3 { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #4a9; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
.code-audit ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2rem; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #bbb; line-height: 1.6; }
.code-audit li { margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
.code-audit code { background: #1a1a1a; padding: 0.1rem 0.3rem; color: #ff8800; }
.code-source { background: #111; padding: 1rem; overflow-x: auto; font-size: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.4; color: #ccc; white-space: pre; }
</style>

<script>
(function() {
  var currentSession = null;

  // API key lives ONLY in sessionStorage (cleared when tab closes)
  function getKey() { return sessionStorage.getItem('resolve_api_key') || ''; }
  function setKey(k) { sessionStorage.setItem('resolve_api_key', k); }
  function clearKeyStore() { sessionStorage.removeItem('resolve_api_key'); }

  function showKeyEntry() {
    document.getElementById('keyEntry').style.display = 'block';
    document.getElementById('chatContainer').style.display = 'none';
  }

  function showChat() {
    document.getElementById('keyEntry').style.display = 'none';
    document.getElementById('chatContainer').style.display = 'block';
    loadSessions();
  }

  // Check if key already in sessionStorage
  if (getKey()) { showChat(); } else { showKeyEntry(); }

  document.getElementById('saveKey').addEventListener('click', function() {
    var key = document.getElementById('apiKeyInput').value.trim();
    if (!key.startsWith('sk-ant-')) { alert('Key should start with sk-ant-'); return; }
    setKey(key);
    showChat();
  });

  document.getElementById('clearKey').addEventListener('click', function() {
    clearKeyStore();
    showKeyEntry();
  });

  function toggleCode() {
    var panel = document.getElementById('codePanel');
    panel.style.display = panel.style.display === 'none' ? 'block' : 'none';
    if (panel.style.display === 'block' && document.getElementById('sourceCode').textContent === 'Loading...') {
      fetch('/api/resolve/source').then(function(r) { return r.text(); }).then(function(src) {
        document.getElementById('sourceCode').textContent = src;
      });
    }
  }

  document.getElementById('showCode').addEventListener('click', toggleCode);
  if (document.getElementById('showCodeEntry')) {
    document.getElementById('showCodeEntry').addEventListener('click', toggleCode);
  }

  document.getElementById('hideCode').addEventListener('click', function() {
    document.getElementById('codePanel').style.display = 'none';
  });

  function api(method, path, body) {
    var opts = {
      method: method,
      headers: {
        'Content-Type': 'application/json',
        'X-Api-Key': getKey()
      }
    };
    if (body) opts.body = JSON.stringify(body);
    return fetch(path, opts).then(function(r) { return r.json(); });
  }

  function loadSessions() {
    api('GET', '/api/resolve/sessions').then(function(sessions) {
      var html = '';
      sessions.forEach(function(s) {
        html += '<div class="session-item" data-id="' + s.id + '">' +
          (s.title || 'Untitled') + ' <span style="color:#555;font-size:0.75rem;">' + (s.created_at || '') + '</span></div>';
      });
      document.getElementById('sessions').innerHTML = html;
      document.querySelectorAll('.session-item').forEach(function(el) {
        el.addEventListener('click', function() { openSession(el.dataset.id); });
      });
    });
  }

  function openSession(id) {
    currentSession = id;
    document.getElementById('chatArea').style.display = 'flex';
    api('GET', '/api/resolve/sessions/' + id + '/messages').then(function(msgs) {
      var html = '';
      msgs.forEach(function(m) {
        html += '<div class="msg ' + m.role + '"><div class="role">' + m.role + '</div><div class="content">' + escapeHtml(m.content) + '</div></div>';
      });
      document.getElementById('messages').innerHTML = html;
      scrollToBottom();
    });
  }

  function escapeHtml(text) {
    var d = document.createElement('div');
    d.textContent = text;
    return d.innerHTML;
  }

  function scrollToBottom() {
    var el = document.getElementById('messages');
    el.scrollTop = el.scrollHeight;
  }

  document.getElementById('newSession').addEventListener('click', function() {
    api('POST', '/api/resolve/sessions').then(function(data) {
      currentSession = data.id;
      document.getElementById('chatArea').style.display = 'flex';
      document.getElementById('messages').innerHTML = '';
      loadSessions();
    });
  });

  document.getElementById('chatForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    var input = document.getElementById('userInput');
    var msg = input.value.trim();
    if (!msg || !currentSession) return;

    document.getElementById('messages').innerHTML +=
      '<div class="msg user"><div class="role">user</div><div class="content">' + escapeHtml(msg) + '</div></div>';
    document.getElementById('messages').innerHTML +=
      '<div class="msg assistant thinking" id="thinking"><div class="role">assistant</div><div class="content">resolving...</div></div>';
    input.value = '';
    scrollToBottom();

    var btn = document.querySelector('.resolve-send');
    btn.disabled = true;

    api('POST', '/api/resolve/chat', { sessionId: currentSession, message: msg })
      .then(function(data) {
        var el = document.getElementById('thinking');
        if (el) el.remove();
        if (data.error) {
          document.getElementById('messages').innerHTML +=
            '<div class="msg assistant"><div class="role">error</div><div class="content">' + escapeHtml(data.error) + '</div></div>';
        } else {
          document.getElementById('messages').innerHTML +=
            '<div class="msg assistant"><div class="role">assistant</div><div class="content">' + escapeHtml(data.content || '') + '</div></div>';
        }
        scrollToBottom();
        btn.disabled = false;
      })
      .catch(function(err) {
        var el = document.getElementById('thinking');
        if (el) el.remove();
        document.getElementById('messages').innerHTML +=
          '<div class="msg assistant"><div class="role">error</div><div class="content">' + escapeHtml(String(err)) + '</div></div>';
        btn.disabled = false;
      });
  });
})();
</script>
